<p>Well, like most guides, it'll be the sort of thing that people are directed to whenever there is an issue; that was the original thinking when we came up with this guide. So yes, even though newbies may still not read the basic guides and coldpost, it's still another tool that can be used in the discussion boards and the Drafts Forum to help people pick and choose what to link to, and what way they could use cross-linking most effectively.</p>
